</div>
<p local-id=3D"8d1cf9f3161e">ActiveWest staff, club representatives and vol=
unteers are the stakeholder groups most directly affected by fragmented inf=
ormation and manual administration. Management and the Board are also signi=
ficantly affected because reporting and operational visibility depend on in=
formation being collected from multiple sources.</p>
